# Frontend and design

## Design system (`css/styles.css`)
Tokens: `--bg`, `--surface`, `--ink`, `--muted`, `--accent`, `--font-display`, `--font-body`, `--radius*`, `--shadow*`. Theme: `data-theme` on `<html>`. Accent/fonts — in `useEffect` in `app.jsx` from `TWEAK_DEFAULTS`.

## Layout
- Container: `.container` (1320px).
- New block: class in CSS → JSX. Breakpoint: `720px`.
- Asset paths: `assets/logo.svg`, `assets/uploads/…`
- **Mobile:** new or changed blocks must behave down to **~375px** (no layout-only desktop assumptions); reuse responsive utilities already in `css/styles.css`.

## React
Functional components, `React.useState` / `useEffect`. Pass `navigate` for links. Breadcrumbs — follow `detail-page.jsx`.

## Content vs markup
Copy and features — `js/data/subpages-data.jsx`, `portfolio-data.jsx`. `pages.jsx` — section structure. New subpage: key in `SUBPAGES` + link in `MEGA` (`header-footer.jsx`); `art` = `window.Art*`.

## Design iterations
Edit tokens and classes, not inline pixels. IA/menu changes — align routes first.
